# Outlaws' Fury (CR 611.2c, 700.12a): Bot1 controls Triton Shorethief, a Rogue and so an outlaw, so after the +2/+0 it exiles the top card of its library
# (the Forest below the turn-three draw) and may play it (CR 305.1): the Forest is played from exile as the turn's land drop. Both of Bot1's creatures get exactly +2/+0 (toughness
# unchanged); Bot2's Memnite does not; the pump is over by the next turn.

